          "text": " Kisha Daudi akamwambia mkuu wa Walawi, kwamba awaagize ndugu zao waimbaji, pamoja na vyombo vyao vya kupigia ngoma, vinanda, na vinubi, na matoazi, wavipige na kupaza sauti kwa furaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
