                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " hata ikawa, Mungu alipowajalia Walawi waliolichukua sanduku la Agano la BWANA, wakachinja ng'ombe saba, na kondoo dume saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
